
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>TrustTenant | Rental History Made Simple</title>

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"
        integrity="sha384-QWTKZyjpPEjISv5WaRU9OFeRpok6YctnYmDr5pNlyT2bRjXh0JMhjY6hW+ALEwIH"
        crossorigin="anonymous">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/main.css">

    <style>
        .demo-notice {
            background-color: #fff3e6;
            border-left: 5px solid #dc6707;
            padding: 18px 24px;
            margin: 25px auto;
            max-width: 1100px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            color: #55300e;
        }

        .home-hero {
            padding: 35px 15px;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            color: #dc6707;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .home-hero .lead {
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #555;
        }

        .home-feature {
            max-width: 480px;
        }

        .home-feature h2 {
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .home-feature p {
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #555;
        }

        .featurette {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-evenly;
            gap: 40px;
            padding: 65px 40px;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .featurette img {
            width: 45%;
            height: 350px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .home-about {
            padding: 80px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .home-about h2 {
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .home-about > p {
            max-width: 750px;
            margin: 0 auto 40px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #555;
            font-size: 17px;
        }

        .value-card {
            background: #fafafa;
            border: 1px solid #eee;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 30px;
            height: 100%;
        }

        .value-card h3 {
            color: #dc6707;
            font-size: 21px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .value-card p {
            color: #555;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .home-cta {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 75px 20px;
            background-color: #fff7f0;
        }

        .home-cta h2 {
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .home-cta p {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px;
            color: #555;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .home-primary-btn {
            background-color: #dc6707;
            border: 1px solid #dc6707;
            color: white;
        }

        .home-primary-btn:hover {
            background-color: #b95405;
            border-color: #b95405;
            color: white;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .featurette {
                flex-direction: column;
                padding: 45px 20px;
            }

            .featurette img {
                width: 100%;
                height: 250px;
            }

            .home-feature {
                max-width: 100%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="home">

    <!-- NAVIGATION -->
    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-center justify-content-lg-start">

        <a href="/" class="d-flex align-items-center mb-2 mb-lg-0 text-decoration-none">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                width="70" height="70" fill="orange"
                class="bi bi-building-fill-check"
                viewBox="0 0 16 16"
                style="padding-top: 5%;">
                <path d="M12.5 16a3.5 3.5 0 1 0 0-7 3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7m1.679-4.493-1.335 2.226a.75.75 0 0 1-1.174.144l-.774-.773a.5.5 0 0 1 .708-.708l.547.548 1.17-1.951a.5.5 0 1 1 .858.514"/>
                <path d="M2 1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h10a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v7.256A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 12.5 8a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-3.59 1.787A.5.5 0 0 0 9 9.5v-1a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5h-1a.5.5 0 0 0-.5.5v1a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h1a.5.5 0 0 0 .39-.187A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 8.027 12H6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.5.5V16H3a1 1 0 0 1-1-1zm2 1.5v1a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h1a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-1a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5h-1a.5.5 0 0 0-.5.5m3 0v1a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h1a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-1a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5h-1a.5.5 0 0 0-.5.5m3.5-.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.5.5v1a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h1a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-1a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5zM4 5.5v1a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h1a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-1a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5h-1a.5.5 0 0 0-.5.5M7.5 5a.5.5 0 0 0-.5.5v1a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h1a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-1a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5zm2.5.5v1a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h1a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-1a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5h-1a.5.5 0 0 0-.5.5M4.5 8a.5.5 0 0 0-.5.5v1a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h1a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-1a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5z"/>
            </svg>

            <span class="fs-1" style="color: black; margin-right: 10px;">
                TrustTenant
            </span>
        </a>

        <ul class="nav col-12 col-lg-auto me-lg-auto mb-2 justify-content-center">
            <li><a href="/" class="nav-link px-2 text-secondary">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="#features" class="nav-link px-2">Features</a></li>
            <li><a href="/pricing" class="nav-link px-2">Pricing</a></li>
            <li><a href="#about" class="nav-link px-2">About</a></li>
        </ul>

        <div>
            <button type="button"
                class="btn login-btn btn-outline"
                onclick="window.location.href='/login'">
                Login
            </button>
        </div>

        <div>
            <button type="button"
                class="btn signup-btn"
                style="margin-right: 20px; margin-left: 20px;"
                onclick="window.location.href='/signup'">
                Sign-up
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <hr>

    <div class="demo-notice" role="alert">
        <strong>Demo Website (Fictional Information Only)</strong>
        <p class="mb-0 mt-2">
            TrustTenant is a demonstration project and is not a live
            tenant-screening or rental verification service.
            Please do not enter real personal, sensitive, or identifying
            information anywhere on this website. This includes real names,
            addresses, phone numbers, email addresses, identification numbers,
            financial information, or actual rental histories.
            Use fictional information for all accounts, reports, and messages.
            Information displayed on this website is for demonstration
            purposes only and must not be used to make real rental decisions.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <div class="home-hero">
        <div class="px-4 py-5 my-5 text-center">

            <p class="hero-subtitle">
                A Smarter Approach to Rental History
            </p>

            <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold text-body-emphasis">
                Make More Informed Rental Decisions
            </h1>

            <div class="col-lg-7 mx-auto">

                <p class="lead mb-4 mt-4">
                    A rental application only tells part of the story.
                    TrustTenant is a platform designed to help property
                    owners document rental experiences, explore available
                    rental-history reports, and communicate with other users
                    in one convenient place.
                </p>

                <p class="lead mb-4">
                    Bring greater organization, transparency, and clarity
                    to the rental process.
                </p>

                <div class="d-grid gap-2 d-sm-flex justify-content-sm-center">

                    <button type="button"
                        class="btn home-primary-btn btn-lg px-4"
                        onclick="window.location.href='/signup'">
                        Get Started
                    </button>

                    <button type="button"
                        class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-lg px-4"
                        onclick="window.location.href='/login'">
                        Log In
                    </button>

                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <hr>

    <!-- FEATURES -->
    <div id="features">

        <!-- FEATURE 1 -->
        <div class="row featurette">

            <div class="home-feature">
                <h2>
                    Rental History That Goes Beyond References
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Rental experiences involve more than simply paying
                    rent each month. TrustTenant gives property owners
                    a structured way to document important details
                    about previous tenancies.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Record payment history, property condition, tenancy
                    dates, and overall rental experiences through
                    an easy-to-use reporting system.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Submitted reports can be reviewed by an administrator
                    before becoming available through the platform.
                </p>
            </div>

            <img
                src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/3184416/pexels-photo-3184416.jpeg"
                alt="People collaborating at a table">
        </div>

        <hr>

        <!-- FEATURE 2 -->
        <div class="row featurette">

            <img
                src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/3184416/pexels-photo-3184416.jpeg"
                alt="People reviewing information together">

            <div class="home-feature">
                <h2>
                    Find the Information You Need
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Searching for rental-history information should
                    be straightforward.
                </p>

                <p>
                    TrustTenant allows registered property owners
                    to search for available approved reports and
                    review details about documented rental experiences.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Instead of navigating scattered records,
                    users can access organized information
                    through one convenient interface.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <hr>

        <!-- FEATURE 3 -->
        <div class="row featurette">

            <div class="home-feature">
                <h2>
                    Keep Conversations Connected
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Clear communication is an important part
                    of managing rental relationships.
                </p>

                <p>
                    TrustTenant includes a built-in messaging
                    system that allows registered users to
                    communicate directly within the platform.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Start conversations, exchange messages,
                    and keep rental-related discussions
                    organized without switching between
                    multiple communication tools.
                </p>
            </div>

            <img
                src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/3184416/pexels-photo-3184416.jpeg"
                alt="People communicating and collaborating">
        </div>

    </div>

    <hr>

    <!-- ABOUT -->
    <section id="about" class="home-about container">

        <h2>
            Building a More Transparent Rental Experience
        </h2>

        <p>
            TrustTenant is a prototype exploring how technology
            can make rental-history documentation and communication
            more organized and accessible.
            The goal is to provide property owners with practical
            tools for recording rental experiences and reviewing
            available information through a single platform.
        </p>

        

    </section>

    <hr>

    <!-- CALL TO ACTION -->
    <section class="home-cta">

        <h2>
            Explore TrustTenant
        </h2>

        <p>
            Discover how rental-history reporting, searching,
            and messaging can work together in one platform.
            Property owner registration is currently available
            for demonstration purposes.
        </p>

        <button type="button"
            class="btn home-primary-btn btn-lg px-4"
            onclick="window.location.href='/signup'">
            Create a Demo Account
        </button>

        <p class="small mt-4 mb-0">
            Demo accounts must use fictional information only.
            Tenant and lawyer registration are not currently available.
        </p>

    </section>

    <hr>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <%- include("partials/footer.ejs"); %>

</div>

<script src="/js/script.js"></script>

<script
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"
    integrity="sha384-YvpcrYf0tY3lHB60NNkmXc5s9fDVZLESaAA55NDzOxhy9GkcIdslK1eN7N6jIeHz"
    crossorigin="anonymous">
</script>

</body>
</html>
